%% Proposed alternative only. Do not mix current Agent SDK and legacy V1 APIs.
flowchart LR
  U[Trusted user] --> R[Per-user stateful agent routing]
  R --> A[Letta style agent loop<br/>bounded by application]
  CORE[Always-loaded core<br/>read-only persona and policy] --> A
  A <-->|selective reads| MEM[(Private archive and entity receipts)]
  A --> TOOLS[Domain tool gateway]
  TOOLS --> D[(Immutable records and documents)]
  TOOLS --> K[(Shared correction and rule ledger)]
  TOOLS --> S[Exact result sets and provenance]
  S --> A
  A --> VAL[Local answer validation]
  VAL --> UI[Inline narrative and panels]
  A --> BG[Optional background memory consolidation]
  BG --> MEM
  NOTE[Current SDK uses MemFS system files<br/>legacy V1 uses memory blocks and archive] -.-> CORE
  NOTE -.-> MEM
  WARN[Asset truth changes only through<br/>validated ledger writes] -.-> TOOLS
